1sry|n|Something scraped off; hence, a small piece; a bit; a fragment; a detached, incomplete portion. ; Specifically, a fragment of something written or printed; a brief excerpt; an unconnected extract. ; The crisp substance that remains after drying out animal fat; as, pork scraps. ; Same as Scrap iron, below.	a:c0q,39,2;16lz,25,4;1dub,19,4;1b5y,5,4~16lz,25,4;1dub,19,4;1b5y,5,4;c0q,39,2	v:c0q,29,1~c0q,29,1	V:x2b,65,1~x2b,65,1	n:197b,53,4;1g7i,14,2~197b,53,4;1g7i,14,2	N:29j2,95,3;x2b,75,2;1j2g,58,4;1jda,57,4;197b,56,5;1it4,53,5;7q9,52,4;18cp,36,3;e62,27,1;26m9,25,4;1g7i,4,1~1it4,53,5;197b,56,5;7q9,52,4;1j2g,58,4;1jda,57,4;26m9,25,4;18cp,36,3;29j2,95,3;x2b,75,2;1g7i,4,1;e62,27,1
